// =============================================================================
// M1 resistor PEX — Calibre xRC rules (educational)
// =============================================================================
// Layers (generate_layout.rb):
//   M1    GDS 31/0
//   PIN1  GDS 91/0   net ports A/B (must sit ON M1)
//
// Sheet resistance matches KLayout demo: 0.08 ohm/square.
// Paths / SVDB / netlist names come from run_calibre_pex.sh (temp run deck).
//
// Flow:  calibre -xrc -phdb → -pdb -r → -fmt -r
// =============================================================================

PRECISION 1000
RESOLUTION 1
UNIT LENGTH U
UNIT RESISTANCE OHM
UNIT CAPACITANCE FF

LAYOUT SYSTEM GDSII
LAYOUT CASE YES

MASK RESULTS DATABASE NONE

LAYER M1 31
LAYER PIN1 91

TEXT LAYER PIN1
TEXT DEPTH PRIMARY
PORT LAYER TEXT PIN1
ATTACH PIN1 M1

CONNECT M1

RESISTANCE SHEET M1 [0.08 0]
CAPACITANCE ORDER M1

PEX REPORT LUMPED NONE
LVS REPORT NONE
LVS REPORT MAXIMUM 50
LVS IGNORE PORTS YES
